WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.963
Plenty of project information. But where do you really stand?

2
00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:13.750
Over twelve months, Mantiva360 evolved alongside multiple projects. Each delivery challenge
informed the next iteration.

3
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.833
It began with financial tracking: bringing budgets, forecasts and actuals into view.

4
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:25.881
Invoice reconciliation added another layer of commercial control.

5
00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:33.479
The plan on a page connected activities, dependencies and resources to the delivery picture.

6
00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:41.189
Evidence-based earned value brought supporting evidence into the assurance of reported
progress.

7
00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:50.333
The 360 Cockpit brought attention, cause, action and impact together, helping teams focus on
what matters.

8
00:00:51.750 --> 00:00:58.178
Scenario modelling opened up alternatives, making resource and cost trade-offs easier to
explore.

9
00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:03.407
Change requests brought scope and resource decisions into a governed process.

10
00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:13.881
Today, AI agents assist analysis. Calculation engines compute the controls. People remain
accountable for decisions.

11
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:24.750
Integrated reporting carries that connected picture into the conversation. Less time
reconstructing status. More time controlling delivery.

12
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:29.348
Mantiva360. Data to Progress. Let's see it in action.
